# Frames of the terrain-shadow lane (lane/terrain-shadow), kept off-repo under ~/.cache/overmatch/terrain-shadow/.
# before = main at 2d9b4635 (vendored heightfield patch); after = the game-side seam. Hidden window, 1280x720,
# scale 1, empty config dir. Plans: scripts/capture/terrain-shadow/*.ron and scripts/capture/surroundings/{p3-hill,
# p4-hill-sight,hull-closeup}.ron with out redirected; OVERMATCH_START as each plan's header names.
# A plan's second counts from the process start, and the offline duel spawns on the first frame its assets have
# loaded, a wall-clock race: two runs can frame a tank one frame (1/64 s) apart in age. MEASURED: after/p4-hill-sight
# taken at 12 s - 1/64 equals before/p4-hill-sight byte for byte, and a rerun of hull-closeup at the surface-data
# commit equals after/hull-closeup at the same offset.
